","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:201109","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"中丸 真吏","creatorId":"vndb:s36202","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36202","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36202","name":"中丸 真吏","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:201112","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"9mm Parabellum Bullet","creatorId":"vndb:s42170","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s42170","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s42170","name":"9mm Parabellum Bullet","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:201113","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"草深 末彩来","creatorId":"vndb:s50018","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50018","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50018","name":"草深 末彩来","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:201114","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ウニコ","creatorId":"vndb:s25766","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25766","name":"有限会社ウニコ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:201115","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143520","characterName":"ジュリエット・ローズ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143520"},"originalCharacterName":"ジュリエット・ローズ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I won't let vampires take anything else from me – not a single damn thing.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Vampire hunter"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interest: Parfait"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Flechette Gun"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An elite vampire hunter and member of the Elpis 7. After her brother, her only living relative, was killed by a vampire, she swore revenge and devoted her life to that of a vampire hunter. Rather than let her hatred consume her, she fights with beauty and strength, which has led to her popularity as a savior of the people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is just as formidable off of the battlefield, and when challenged to games by the residents of Hemeria, she isn't above cheating to get her way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The news of the discovery of an entrance to Nyx, the world of the vampires, stokes a flame within her, and she dives head first into a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to seek revenge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Voltage Inc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143520"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e9a16bfe6b64cbb87af4efd95e26dcd903b14b1945f3936ebbc6638094a7387.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/085e9fec49eaeea71d733fae63dca9c58c9ae3ff15b75df662dc3dce3f006fa8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143521","characterName":"キーラン・ローウェル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143521"},"originalCharacterName":"キーラン・ローウェル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1222"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"The weak are simply sustenance. That's just a fact.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Vampire hunter"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interest: Tempering"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Longsword"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even among the elite vampire hunters that make up the Elpis 7, he is lauded as the strongest. There are whispers that he defeated an aristos vampire at the age of ten."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Preferring solitude and isolation, he rarely mixes with others. However, he thinks favorably of those in pursuit of strength, and will at times cooperate with the heroine. He takes pride in his own strength, honed by his daily training, but he is pragmatic and will not engage in reckless battle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When summoned by the kingdom to join the invasion of Nyx, he is the one whose intentions most closely mirror the heroine's. He is their trump card."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Voltage Inc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143521"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c882401836eb619d7c1ae4bafdc4da1722d60a175f87ed5a243dab66e6ea35ce.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69b74ff22c85729b9b743d932b5fd46ec062b73d727448ab6eb486b46c30f6cb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"江口 拓也","creatorId":"vndb:s40","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s40","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s40","name":"江口 拓也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96433","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143522","characterName":"ギャレット・ウェルキン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143522"},"originalCharacterName":"ギャレット・ウェルキン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"810"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"When heroes break, the whole world will be tainted with despair.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Commander of the Royal Order of Hemeria"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interest: Stars"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Spear"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The hero of Hemeria, promoted to Commander of the Royal Order at a young age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The reason behind his ascension to Commander at such a young age is due to the large scale vampire assault he faced in his youth. Many of his fellow trainees lost their lives, but he was the sole survivor, saving the lives of many citizens, and hailed as a hero. He is the public's brightest hope against their fear of vampires."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he has a serious and stubborn side, and claims to hate vampire hunters, he appears before the heroine as the commander of the hunt party."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Voltage Inc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143522"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/22e0b8a297eb1f7cdf109252533f3a4cd1c8edd1b6e93e410f83fff54bae1a7c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95078c97d3078a1652c4e351b4ed4c79445bf0c696df3a73ab6eec8d5735221c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浪川 大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s135","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s135","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s135","name":"浪川 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96436","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143523","characterName":"アシェル・トンプソン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143523"},"originalCharacterName":"アシェル・トンプソン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1008"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If only this moment could last forever.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Vampire hunter"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interest: The sun"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Dual Blades"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend of the heroine, with a bright and gentle personality. After an abrupt disappearance he eventually returns, having made a name for himself as one of the Elpis 7."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Both of his parents, the Thompsons, serve as both vampire hunters and mentors towards the heroine. He's a ray of sunshine amongst the otherwise dour members of the squad, but unlike the Asher the heroine knew in her youth, there's an air of mystery about him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His sunny disposition is the foundation of the trust between the hunters, with the hope his light will cut through the darkness of Nyx."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Voltage Inc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143523"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3a9563c0e720b6bc4840bdcdd9f87bddefcf40f40eb427c2e2ff5213fe99459.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2c417d2ee539b9a8f662d5c01cfeb7baf9e00c514498ad0c42677f1c0d2a7ad.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本 信彦","creatorId":"vndb:s550","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s550","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s550","name":"岡本 信彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96438","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143524","characterName":"ロドス・ハートフィールド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143524"},"originalCharacterName":"ロドス・ハートフィールド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"430"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Some things are preferable to death. Not that I am capable of dying.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Vampire"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interest: Flowers"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Rapier"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An elegant and beautiful aristos vampire. An immortal being with a preference for human blood and manipulator of magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cloaked in the fragrance of flowers, he seduces his victims with his soft smile and sweet words. He conceals his true identity from the heroine, sneaking into the crevices of her heart to compel her to do his bidding."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Does he wish to prey on humans, or does he despise them? His true intentions are unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Voltage Inc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143524"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20480ce445b681e4921d67d48724ad5bca5e2abc89e345b6daaa11bd6a92c26f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43a046af9ec91d07d748276ba5d28487cdd66687e3d02a79ad51e5fa708fdaef.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"河西 健吾","creatorId":"vndb:s5932","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5932","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5932","name":"河西健吾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96441","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c143525","characterName":"アイリーン・ウィンダム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c143525"},"originalCharacterName":"アイリーン・ウィンダム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"927"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"That's when I decided; I'll be the one to protect that person's slumber.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Vampire hunter"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Interest: Rock"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Ninjato"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sisterly vampire hunter with a frank, open-hearted personality. After graduating from the seminary, she did not join the church, but became a gravedigger and hunter, preying on vampires who gather at the cemetery at the foot of the Red Bell Tree."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and Jack were classmates at the seminary."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Voltage Inc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c143525"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/3876ad4f3197ceaf4031f7667e396c142cd5f39209e7ec0a03c89ec877be64ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff074ede02dfbb672c85abbb3f1935ac236dd717d69b96c6f3212c9d1af04711.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊瀬 茉莉也","creatorId":"vndb:s4898","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4898","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4898","name":"伊瀬 茉莉也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96439","source":"vndb"}]},{"character